### Wavy Tutor — executable API collection (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@host = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### (Phase 5) Create a session
# POST {{host}}/api/sessions
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "lang": "en" }

### (Phase 5) Post a message
# POST {{host}}/api/sessions/REPLACE_SESSION_ID/messages
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "message": "How do I compare 2/5 and 1/2?" }

### (Phase 5) Get a session transcript
# GET {{host}}/api/sessions/REPLACE_SESSION_ID
